 "nested_inconsistency": [
  {
   "object": "author / member（用户卡片）",
   "diff": "11 个上下文 61 键并集，无两个上下文完全一致。关键分歧：(1) is_privacy 仅 answer_detail author 有，answers 列表 author 无；(2) 推荐流 author 用 followers_count，members/followees/followers 用 follower_count——同一指标两种命名；(3) vip_info/kvip_info 只在 comment author.member、activities actor、member 端点与 collections/items 的 answer/article author 出现；10/12 的 answers/article 列表 author 不带 vip 信息（13-live-collections 已实测集合条目 author.vip_info 存在）；(4) badge_v2 在 answers/article author、activities actor、member 端点有，comment author.member 只有 badge 无 badge_v2，recommend 两个 author 只有 badge 无 badge_v2，hot-list author 8 键最简（无 gender/badge/vip）；(5) ip_info 仅 member 端点（detail 为 string，列表恒 null）；(6) comment author 是唯一 {role, member} 两层包装，role 键仅评论有；(7) uid/description/exposed_medal 仅 zhuanlan 详情 author 有；(8) badge 数组元素形状只在 recommend question.author 见过 {description,type}，answers/activities/member 的 badge 恒空数组、元素形状未验证；(9) followees/followers 列表 kvip_info 多 target_url，member_detail 的 kvip_info 没有"
  },
  {
   "object": "question",
   "diff": "5 个上下文 18 键并集。answer_count/comment_count/follower_count 只在 feed 三处（activities 16 键/hot-list 12 键/recommend 15 键）出现，answers 两处的 question 不给；visit_count 仅 answers 列表 include 有（answers 详情、activities、hot-list、recommend 均无）；updated_time 仅 answers 两处有（activities question 无）；detail/excerpt 仅 activities/recommend 有；relationship 形状三种：answer_detail 恒空对象、activities 为 {voting,is_thanked,is_nothelp,upvoted_followee_ids}、recommend 为 {is_author}；author 在 answer_detail 的 question 里缺席"
  },
  {
   "object": "reaction",
   "diff": "列表与推荐流恒 2+2 键（statistics{like_count,favorites} + relation{faved,liked}，answers 列表/articles 列表/recommend 三处一致）；全量只在详情：answer detail statistics 17 键、article detail statistics 18 键、relation 10 键、另含 image_reactions。顶层浏览量命名分叉：recommend target 用 visited_count，answers 列表/detail 用 visit_count"
  },
  {
   "object": "paging",
   "diff": "标准 v4 列表（answers/articles/members/followees/root_comments）与 hot-list/recommend 均为 5 键 {is_end,is_start,next,previous,totals}；child_comments 的 paging 无 is_start；v3 activities 的 paging 仅 {is_end,need_force_login,next}——无 previous/totals，多 need_force_login，且游标是时间戳+page_num 而非 offset"
  },
  {
   "object": "badge / badge_v2",
   "diff": "badge_v2 内层 {title,merged_badges,detail_badges,icon,night_icon} 在 answers author 与 member detail 一致（activities actor 未枚举内层）；comment author.member 与 recommend author 无 badge_v2；badge 数组元素唯一实证形状为 recommend question.author 的 {description,type}"
  },
  {
   "object": "topic",
   "diff": "member 内嵌 topic 为 {id,type:\"topic\",url,name,avatar_url}（locations/business/educations 共用）；zhuanlan 详情 topics[] 为 {id,name,url}（无 type/avatar_url）；feed 三处只用 bound_topic_ids（纯 number 数组）不嵌对象"
  }
 ],
